  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kajo Keji Shea Nut Butter Oil Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to develop LWMCSs capacity in financial and business management; and to improve its production capacity by establishing a sheanut purchase fund and purchasing an oil expeller and related equipment to produce grade A sheabutter for export.</narrative>
  </description>
